  "sections": [
    {
      "heading": "Marine Marts",
      "level": 2,
      "markdown": "Marine Corps MCX Marine Marts offer a variety of essentials: grab-and-go food, prepared hot food and coffee bar, snacks, beverages, health and beauty products, personal hygiene items, cleaning supplies, select uniform items, magazines, and much more."
    },
    {
      "heading": "MCX24",
      "level": 2,
      "markdown": "Marines, are you looking for convenience? MCX 24-hour access, you can shop anytime, day or night. Whether you're looking for snacks, drinks, or hot prepared food items, you'll find it here.\n\n**Micro Marts**\n• Micro Mart – ACU5, BLDG 31903, Camp Pendleton, CA\n• Micro Mart – Air Wing, BLDG 23166, Camp Pendleton, CA\n• Micro Mart – ASP, BLDG 43950, Camp Pendleton, CA\n• Micro Mart – BLDG 140091, Camp Pendleton, CA\n• Micro Mart – BLDG 140114, BDLG 140114, Camp Pendleton, CA\n• Micro Mart – CLR-17, BLDG 140210, Camp Pendleton, CA\n• Micro Mart – Edson Range, BLDG 31604, Camp Pendleton, CA\n• Micro Mart – G-6, BLDG 1270, Camp Pendleton, CA\n• Micro Mart – Horno, BLDG 530320, Camp Pendleton, CA\n• Micro Mart – Las Flores, BLDG 4100377, Camp Pendleton, CA\n• Micro Mart – Las Pulgas, BLDG 43301, Camp Pendleton, CA\n• Micro Mart – Margarita, BLDG 3382, Camp Pendleton, CA\n• Micro Mart – MCI West, BLDG 1160, Camp Pendleton, CA\n• Micro Mart – MCTSSA, BLDG 31357, Camp Pendleton, CA\n• Micro Mart – MWS-372, BLDG 25264, Camp Pendleton, CA\n• Micro Mart – Naval Hospital, H-20, Camp Pendleton, CA\n• Micro Mart – Talega, BLDG 61331, Camp Pendleton, CA\n• Micro Mart – Wounded Warrior, BLDG 27850, Camp Pendleton, CA\n• Micro Mart – Hilltop, BLDG 32877, Camp Pendleton, CA\n• Micro Mart – MCAS, BLDG 2398, Camp Pendleton, CA\n• Micro Mart – Pico, BLDG 24026, Camp Pendleton, CA"
    },
